        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nTo see current offers or place your own offer on this property, please visit SherryFitz.ie and register for your mySherryFitz account.\n186 Millbrook is a 3 bed, end-terrace home that has been recently refurbished throughout in this peaceful and well established development in Johnstown, Navan. The property is set on a generous site in the development and benefits from a lawn to the front with private parking and an ample fenced in back garden \nCentrally located within easy distance of Navan town centre, Johnstown Village, within walking distance of local primary and secondary schools and close access to the M3 motorway. If you are in the market for a new home at an affordable price, look no further. Early viewing is recommended."
      },
